This repository contains a standalone adaptation of the curvature keypoint
selection workflow from:

  isaacsim/sdg/keypoint_detector/core.py
  PCGSplineCurvatureDetector
  Copyright 2024-2025 NVIDIA Corporation & Affiliates
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The adaptation is in src/contour_keypoints.py. It extracts the threshold,
adaptive-percentile, multi-level, and distance-filtering concepts, replaces
the Isaac Sim configuration/runtime with standalone parameters, and uses a
NumPy/OpenCV contour representation. The source repository's other files and
its proprietary configuration module are not included.

